        ],
        "abstract": "Both this paper and the previous one by the same authors, (their Ref 3) are the result of co-operation between industry and university which have resulted in meaningful and interesting results regarding the performance of a large induction motor. It is interesting to note in paragraph 4 of the paper just mentioned that the rotor bar impedance is of the same order as its resistance, whereas on the usual much smaller university laboratory machine the resistance would have been substantially greater and the results would have been significantly different and would not have been accurate if extrapolated.",
